WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.491 --> 00:00:06.150
How to get through hard times.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.277
A buddy of mine is going through a hard time in his life right now

00:00:09.277 --> 00:00:14.725
and I sent him a message today to encourage him and to support him.

00:00:14.725 --> 00:00:20.446
And I realized that what I wrote in that message I've never really shared with people before,

00:00:20.446 --> 00:00:22.775
I haven't shared it with you.

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:28.107
And I thought that the message might help you if you're going through a hard time

00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:33.035
in your life right now. And it's sharing my story from what happened to me last year.

00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:38.564
Last year was a really hard year for me, both from a business perspective and a personal perspective.

00:00:38.564 --> 00:00:41.263
On the business side...

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:46.208
I was growing less and less happy with what I was doing.

00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:49.660
Most of my money came from advertising. I had a popular website,

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.996
had over 20 million people visit my site.

00:00:51.996 --> 00:00:55.037
So you can sell advertising against that and make money from it.

00:00:55.037 --> 00:00:59.953
The problem for me there was that I was creating content that would just generate a lot of views

00:00:59.953 --> 00:01:02.562
so I could sell a lot of advertising.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:08.274
And it wasn't necessarily stuff that I was proud of or would really help entrepreneurs,

00:01:08.274 --> 00:01:10.104
which was my passion.

00:01:10.104 --> 00:01:13.077
So I felt increasingly disconnected from my business.

00:01:13.077 --> 00:01:18.633
And as a result, last year I totally changed my model, took off all the adds on my site

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:24.251
and took my biggest revenue source and brought it to zero,

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:27.066
which was really stressful.

00:01:27.066 --> 00:01:29.463
And, basically, I was starting over.

00:01:29.463 --> 00:01:32.467
Starting over with a new business model to help entrepreneurs.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:37.793
On a personal level, my life was falling apart in a lot of different areas.

00:01:37.793 --> 00:01:42.803
I went through a divorce, which was the most stressful thing that I've ever had to go through

00:01:42.803 --> 00:01:47.516
in my life. And I hope that you never have to go through that.

00:01:47.516 --> 00:01:54.147
I spent 1.6 million dollars building my dream house and then had to sell it.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:57.798
I basically cost, so I didn't make a profit on it.

00:01:57.798 --> 00:02:03.419
I gained 15 lbs. and for the first time in my life had to watch what I was eating and pay attention

00:02:03.419 --> 00:02:06.528
to that, where I never had to worry before.

00:02:06.528 --> 00:02:11.662
I started losing my hair for the first time in my life too from all the stress and craziness.

00:02:11.662 --> 00:02:15.733
And people in my family, you know? Passed away and that created more stress.

00:02:15.733 --> 00:02:18.211
It was a tough year.

00:02:18.211 --> 00:02:22.328
It's funny how in life sometimes when something is going wrong,

00:02:22.328 --> 00:02:25.139
everything seems to go wrong at once.

00:02:25.139 --> 00:02:28.964
And just when you think something is, you know? You're just getting better...

00:02:28.964 --> 00:02:31.913
something hits you in the stomach even harder.

00:02:31.913 --> 00:02:34.075
That's kind of how the pattern goes.

00:02:34.075 --> 00:02:37.535
And the advice that I gave to my friend was what helped me get through it,

00:02:37.535 --> 00:02:42.033
because it was a really challenging, tough year; but what helped me get through

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:44.919
was feeling like I was doing something important.

00:02:44.919 --> 00:02:49.199
It was making these videos, helping you guys, answering your questions,

00:02:49.199 --> 00:02:53.939
feeling like I was giving back and helping people through the only way that I knew how,

00:02:53.939 --> 00:02:56.334
which is through entrepreneurship.

00:02:56.334 --> 00:03:00.169
And by helping you guys and by seeing the responses on the videos

00:03:00.169 --> 00:03:05.222
and by knowing that I've helped your business get better, I've helped you become

00:03:05.222 --> 00:03:10.314
a better entrepreneur and you're out taking that knowledge and helping more people.

00:03:10.314 --> 00:03:16.236
That making me feel that I was doing something important, that got me through all the tough

00:03:16.236 --> 00:03:19.159
times that I experienced last year and keeps getting me through.

00:03:19.159 --> 00:03:23.711
This is what gets me up every day, it's feeling like I'm doing something important.

00:03:23.711 --> 00:03:27.809
So if you're going through a challenging time in your life,

00:03:27.809 --> 00:03:32.320
either right now or one that's coming up because... you know? it's going to come...

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:38.094
try to do something that makes you feel like you're doing something important.

00:03:38.094 --> 00:03:43.368
It's what's going to help you get through. Use the skills, the knowledge, the expertise that you have

00:03:43.368 --> 00:03:49.564
to help somebody. And when you see them smile and you see them say "thank you"

00:03:49.564 --> 00:03:55.340
and when you see them say "you've changed my life", that will change YOU

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:58.789
and make you want to do more. And it'll make you a better person

00:03:58.789 --> 00:04:01.911
and it'll make you a way better entrepreneur as well.

00:04:01.911 --> 00:04:08.993
And, hopefully, by helping other people you'll end up healing yourself as well.

00:04:08.993 --> 00:04:12.787
It worked for me and I hope it works for you.

00:04:12.787 --> 00:04:14.472
Believe!

00:04:14.472 --> 00:04:17.666
For those of you watching and like the video, please give it a thumbs up below.

00:04:17.666 --> 00:04:21.211
Let me know what you think, leave a comment underneath, you know those get me going!

00:04:21.211 --> 00:04:24.073
This is what I do.

00:04:24.073 --> 00:04:26.292
So thank you, guys and I'll see you soon.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.000
